<view class="screen payment-screen"><view class="intro"><view class="title">登记收付款</view><view class="desc">系统按日期从最早的欠款开始冲抵，多出的金额会保留为预收或预付款。</view></view><view class="direction"><view class="choice {{direction === 'RECEIVABLE' ? 'active receive' : ''}}" data-value="RECEIVABLE" bindtap="selectDirection">收到客户货款</view><view class="choice {{direction === 'PAYABLE' ? 'active pay' : ''}}" data-value="PAYABLE" bindtap="selectDirection">付给厂商货款</view></view><view class="form-card"><view class="field"><view class="label">{{direction === 'RECEIVABLE' ? '付款客户' : '收款厂商'}} *</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{parties}}" range-key="name" value="{{partyIndex < 0 ? 0 : partyIndex}}" bindchange="party"><view class="picker {{partyIndex < 0 ? 'placeholder' : ''}}">{{partyIndex < 0 ? '请选择' : parties[partyIndex].name}}<text>›</text></view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{date}}<text>›</text></view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">金额 *</view><input type="digit" aria-label="收付款金额" placeholder="0.00" value="{{amount}}" data-field="amount" bindinput="input" /></view><view class="field"><view class="label">方式</view><input aria-label="收付款方式" placeholder="微信、现金、银行转账" value="{{method}}" data-field="method" bindinput="input" /></view><view class="field"><view class="label">备注</view><textarea maxlength="500" aria-label="收付款备注" placeholder="可填写流水号或说明" value="{{note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="input" /></view></view><view class="space"></view><view class="fixed-action"><button class="fixed-primary" disabled="{{saving || loading}}" bindtap="save">{{saving ? '正在冲账…' : '保存并自动冲账'}}</button></view></view>
